        "description": "<p>9to5 Mac has <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/09/ios-27-here-are-apples-full-release-notes/\">the iOS 27 release notes</a> too. I haven\u2019t spent much time using Golden Gate, but I\u2019ve been using iOS 27 full-time ever since WWDC. It\u2019s in excellent shape for a .0 release.</p>\n\n<p>Now I need to think about how long I want to still hang onto MacOS 15 Sequoia on my main Mac. I\u2019ll probably skip 27.0 and wait for 27.1, but maybe I\u2019ll bite the bullet and upgrade when a 27.0.1 update comes out.</p>\n\n<div>\n<a  title=\"Permanent link to \u2018Apple\u2019s OS 27 Updates Will Be Released on Monday, 14 September\u2019\"  href=\"https://daringfireball.net/linked/2026/09/10/os-27-release-date-monday-14-september\">&nbsp;\u2605&nbsp;</a>\n</div>",
